huckles is really made of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and be the first to step into world of Chuckles.</p>", "short_description": "Misadventures of Chuckles is a top-down action-adventure RPG featuring a unique Laughter–Anger–Sadness emotion-based combat system. Players explore a hand-drawn world, utilizing tactical emotional combat to solve puzzles, recruit companions, and restore balance to a falling world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062320/33a32282af39db6e9e1d8fcc98359f68a426af8e/header.jpg?t=1786442243", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062320/487ab87cee04e9aaca2aa2f72db81c8037f55217/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786442243", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062320/487ab87cee04e9aaca2aa2f72db81c8037f55217/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786442243", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 @ 2.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 or RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 @ 3.0 GHz or AMD Ryzen 5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2060 or RX 7600xt or equiva